    problemIntuition: 'At each step, choose a candidate that fits in the remaining sum, then recurse with the reduced target. To avoid duplicates like `[2,3,2]` and `[2,2,3]`, only allow candidates at or after the current index. Reuse is allowed, so the same index stays available. Sorting the candidates lets the search stop as soon as a candidate exceeds the remaining sum.',
