    problemIntuition: 'The graph has exactly one cycle, and any edge on that cycle is removable. The answer must be the last such edge in the input. Processing edges in order, the first edge whose endpoints are already connected by earlier edges is the one that closes the cycle. That edge is also the last one in the input among cycle edges, because any later cycle-closing edge would only be found after it.',
